+---
+id: "n_0221_dd57"
+type: "note"
+title: "Factory pin sed on macOS: BSD sed -E does NOT support \s — the (factory_ref:\s*)sha replacement silently never matched, leaving uses@ on the new sha while factory_ref stayed on the old one (2026-09-22: skew acc3ded→54e86fd on BOTH fa and dmtools-dart main; caught by factory_stub_ref_test \"factory_ref must repeat the uses-ref literally\", red on main + every refreshed branch). ALWAYS pin with python re.sub (r'(factory_ref:\s*)[0-9a-f]{40}'), never sed with \s. Fix PRs: fa #851, dart #225."
+author: "agent"
+date: "2026-09-22T20:57:58.045182Z"
+area: "project"
+topics: []
+source: "agent"
+accessCount: 0
+importance: 0.5
+tags: ["#note", "#source_agent", "pinning", "macos", "sed", "gotcha", "fa", "dmtools-dart"]
+---
+
+
+# Note: n_0221_dd57
+
+Factory pin sed on macOS: BSD sed -E does NOT support \s — the (factory_ref:\s*)sha replacement silently never matched, leaving uses@ on the new sha while factory_ref stayed on the old one (2026-09-22: skew acc3ded→54e86fd on BOTH fa and dmtools-dart main; caught by factory_stub_ref_test "factory_ref must repeat the uses-ref literally", red on main + every refreshed branch). ALWAYS pin with python re.sub (r'(factory_ref:\s*)[0-9a-f]{40}'), never sed with \s. Fix PRs: fa #851, dart #225.
+
+**By:** [[agent]]
+**Date:** 2026-09-22T20:57:58.045182Z
+**Area:** [[project|project]]
